* ngspice settings for SKY130 (generated by bootstrap.sh). Copy to
* ~/.spiceinit or to your simulation directory as .spiceinit. These are the
* settings the PDK's own libs.tech/ngspice/spinit uses: HSPICE-compatible
* parsing for the model files, and no model-binning check.
set ngbehavior=hsa
set ng_nomodcheck
